# Next.js Web App

Stack: Next.js 15, React 19, TypeScript 5, Tailwind CSS, Auth.js v5, Drizzle ORM, Anthropic SDK.

## Patterns

- AI routes live under `app/api/ai-*` and `app/api/generate-plc/`; shared logic in `lib/claude.ts`.
- Protected routes: `(features)` group guarded by `middleware.ts`; auth in `auth.ts` / `auth.config.ts`.
- DB schema: `lib/db/schema.ts` — change schema → `npm run db:generate` → review SQL → `npm run db:migrate`.
- PLC model data: `lib/plc-models-database.ts`, `app/data/plc-models.ts`.

## Quality

- Prefer `npx tsc --noEmit` over relying on build (`ignoreBuildErrors: true` is set).
- Use env vars for secrets; keep `.env.example` in sync.
- No emojis in UI; use `app/components/Icon.tsx` (Material Icons).

## Verify

```bash
npm run lint
npx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json
npm run build
```
